cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it as below."
title: "PumpGuard AI: an educational open-source toolkit for centrifugal-pump vibration monitoring"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "PumpGuard AI contributors"
version: 0.3.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  PumpGuard AI is a research and teaching prototype for rotating-machinery condition
  monitoring. It provides a transparent synthetic vibration generator for centrifugal
  pumps, time-domain, spectral and envelope-analysis features, bearing defect
  frequencies, and leakage-aware dataset utilities. It is not validated for diagnosing
  real equipment.
keywords:
  - condition monitoring
  - predictive maintenance
  - vibration analysis
  - centrifugal pump
  - bearing fault
  - envelope analysis
repository-code: "https://github.com/ymesbah-blip/-PumpGuard-AI"
